  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UK Support to United Nations High Level Panel on the economic empowerment of women and girls</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To provide High-level leadership to accelerate action to improve jobs, incomes and economic opportunities for women and girls. The UK will provide funding to support an independent Lead Author and Secretariat, hosted within UN Women, to facilitate the Panel. The Panel will provide a focal point for political support and tangible action to create real momentum around the Sustainable Development Goals and targets to empower women, particularly those on access to resources, better jobs and working conditions and the reduction in the unpaid work burden.</narrative>
  </description>
